      </div>
      <p class="tcp-pushpa-item__tagline">&ldquo;{{ section.settings.shakti_tagline | default: 'Quiet Strength' }}&rdquo;</p>
      <p class="tcp-pushpa-item__desc">
        {{ section.settings.shakti_desc | default: 'Grounded architectural weight, earthy raw clay finish, high-fired at 1280°C for daily resilience. Embodies the quiet fortitude left behind in spirit.' }}
